    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d296">

                <pb facs="0621" n="511" xml:id="pg511"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Blaine to Mr. Snowden.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-03-21"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 21,
                        1890</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 30.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The protocol explanatory of the scope and
                    effect of article <hi rendition="#small-caps">i</hi> of the treaty between the
                    United States of America and Greece of December 10–22, 1837, which accompanied
                    your dispatch No. 28 of the 4th ultimo, has been received. The Department has
                    approved the protocol in question and printed the same for the information of
                    the public.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">James G. Blaine.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
